#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:19
msgid "Mouse:"
msgstr "鼠标："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:20
msgid "let clicks through to the desktop"
msgstr "让点击穿透到桌面"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:24
msgid ""
"While clicks go through, both mouse buttons land on the desktop.\n"
"The widget takes the mouse only in the desktop's edit mode:\n"
"that is where its settings are, or ./install.sh with the clicks off switch."
msgstr ""
"点击穿透时，鼠标左右键都会落到桌面上。\n"
"小部件只在桌面的编辑模式下接管鼠标：\n"
"设置也在那里，或带 clicks off 开关运行 ./install.sh。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:38
msgctxt "the account of the widget's own notes: a folder of files"
msgid "local — this machine"
msgstr "本地 — 这台机器"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:74
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:78
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "备注："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:79
msgid "mark the days that have entries, open a sticker on click"
msgstr "标记有记录的日期，点击打开便签"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:83
msgid ""
"A click on a day opens its sticker: the day's events and tasks from the "
"accounts,\n"
"and a note of yours — the first line is its title. Off, the calendar is the "
"plain grid\n"
"and takes no clicks at all."
msgstr ""
"点击某天会打开它的便签：来自账户的当天事件和任务，\n"
"以及您的备注 — 第一行是标题。关闭后，日历只是普通网格，\n"
"不接受任何点击。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:90
msgid "Write notes to:"
msgstr "备注写入："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:98
msgid ""
"“local” keeps them as .ics files in ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes;\n"
"an account from the Accounts page sends them to that calendar as all-day "
"events."
msgstr ""
"“本地”将其保存为 ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes 中的 .ics 文件；\n"
"“账户”页面的账户会把它们作为全天事件发送到该日历。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:105
msgid "Upcoming lines:"
msgstr "“即将”行数："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:112
msgid "The next entries, one per line under the months; 0 hides them."
msgstr "接下来的记录，在月份下方每行一条；0 表示隐藏。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:119
msgid "Fetch the accounts every, min:"
msgstr "账户同步间隔（分钟）："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:125
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Reminders"
msgstr "提醒"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:129
msgid "Reminders:"
msgstr "提醒："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:131
msgid "a sheet by the day's cell when an entry is due"
msgstr "条目到时在当天格子旁弹出一张便签"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:135
msgid ""
"A note whose first line starts with a time — “14:30 Dentist” — becomes a "
"timed\n"
"entry and rings before it; “!Buy milk” stays a note and rings at the hour "
"below.\n"
"The accounts' events ring by their own alarms. Both reach the phone through "
"the\n"
"account. The sheet offers to snooze, to put it off till tomorrow, or done."
msgstr ""
"首行以时间开头的便签 —“14:30 牙医”— 成为带时间的条目并提前提醒；\n"
"“!买牛奶”仍是便签，在下方设定的时刻提醒。账户中的事件按其自身的闹钟提醒。\n"
"两者都通过账户同步到手机。便签提供稍后提醒、推迟到明天或“知道了”。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:142
msgid "Before a timed entry, min:"
msgstr "带时间条目之前，分钟："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:146
msgctxt "no reminder before timed notes"
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:152
msgid "“!” notes ring at:"
msgstr "“!”便签提醒时刻："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:161
msgid "Events without an alarm:"
msgstr "无闹钟的事件："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:163
msgid "ring before them too, as for a timed note"
msgstr "也在其之前提醒，如同带时间的便签"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:168
msgid "Snooze for, min:"
msgstr "稍后提醒，分钟："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:176
msgid "Show missed ones from the last, h:"
msgstr "显示最近几小时内错过的提醒："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:183
msgid "While the machine was off: alarms older than this are dropped quietly."
msgstr "关机期间：早于此时限的提醒会被静默丢弃。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:190
msgid "System notification:"
msgstr "系统通知："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:192
msgid ""
"also through notify-send — in Plasma's history, silenced by Do Not Disturb"
msgstr "同时通过 notify-send — 进入 Plasma 历史，“请勿打扰”时静音"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:197
msgid "Sound file:"
msgstr "声音文件："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:200
msgctxt "placeholder: no sound"
msgid "none — or /usr/share/sounds/freedesktop/stereo/message.oga"
msgstr "无 — 或 /usr/share/sounds/freedesktop/stereo/message.oga"

